  "title": "Uganda’s King Oyo’s Burial Amid Succession Battle",
  "summary": "A TV news presenter has been named as the traditional kingdom of Tooro’s new monarch but the late king’s family claim he chose an heir. The burial of King Oyo Nyimba Kabamba Iguru Rukidi IV takes place in Uganda as news anchor Edward Rukidi Kijanangoma prepares for the formal handover of power in the kingdom.",
